{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1767"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge art/architecture","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/art__architecture.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",523],["+"," Even Michelangelo worked in it: in 1528–29, appointed governor-general of the city's defences, he designed fortifications for besieged Florence, drawing pincer-shaped bastions and fortifying the hill of San Miniato with earthworks; the city nonetheless fell in August 1530."],["=",624]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",511],["+"," Sogar Michelangelo arbeitete darin: 1528/29, zum Generalgouverneur der Stadtbefestigung ernannt, entwarf er für das belagerte Florenz Befestigungsanlagen, zeichnete zangenförmige Bastionen und befestigte den Hügel von San Miniato mit Erdwerken; die Stadt fiel dennoch im August 1530."],["=",586]]}]},
